{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117035657306529792"]}, "author_id": "360423213", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:27:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117035707885867175"], "id": "2117035707885867175", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "On this road trip, I’ve been testing different Agents to see who can tackle some light work load while I’m driving \n\nBetween my Dot and my Muse agent… I’m shocked at how good the Muse agent is even on the free tier. The Dot is great don’t get me wrong..  is it 150$ a month https://t.co/ESIgeXiSLn", "url": "https://x.com/TLeeMcD/status/2117035707885867175"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117035640986726400"]}, "author_id": "922432563683115008", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:26:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117035648288981040"], "id": "2117035648288981040", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116935650511585696", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux My dot is an adorable black cat, but it seems she loves taking naps. https://t.co/0eI7FON1QV", "url": "https://x.com/Grants_and_Soda/status/2117035648288981040"}, {"author_id": "1712708898275385344", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:20:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117034116957048932"], "id": "2117034116957048932", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1712708898275385344", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117033909242507650", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "anyways im just gonna force my dot to protest this and waste everyone's time. so funny how there's always a protest in oakland about \"no kings\" or \"the Epstein class\" yet no one cares about the things that actually screw you over every day.", "url": "https://x.com/mil000/status/2117034116957048932"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117031526122520577", "3_2117031526126772224"]}, "author_id": "95874218", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:10:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117031532850495798"], "id": "2117031532850495798", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2106193305914470567", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Annd my Dot also earned me €1200 on compensations \n\nLove my Dot 🫶 https://t.co/quOPJKZ7lU https://t.co/VIPEAzOxQE", "url": "https://x.com/literallydenis/status/2117031532850495798"}, {"author_id": "1495762321263706120", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:06:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117030472123285616"], "id": "2117030472123285616", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116992258520064397", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @DogecoinNorway I guess @OpenAI dots and @openclaw it is.  Doesn’t have all the capabilities I enjoyed on Grokbot….  But at least no change in rules like this.   I don’t know how business can become users with this unpredictability.  I truly feel scammed.  Goodbye @bot @grok @spacexai", "url": "https://x.com/Kadu_Cos/status/2117030472123285616"}, {"author_id": "1647076250782162946", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:57:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117028240418328666"], "id": "2117028240418328666", "in_reply_to_user_id": "15843059", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116957587216453980", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2117017238934831608", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@H