 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117016144909639967", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@BigK_3D @elonmusk @dvorahfr This sucks. I’ll start looking at other models like moose and ChatGPT dots. It’s ridiculous for him to just suddenly cut the usage pool overnight. I never ran into problems before and I used it heavy,", "url": "https://x.com/realbeandog/status/2117022908547743769"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117021085010890752"]}, "author_id": "2059841602252689414", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:28:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117021091009093798"], "id": "2117021091009093798", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How I’m talking to my Dot at this point.\n\n80% chance it only gets more aggressive. \nPlz release voice mode Muse ily https://t.co/lTtqy2aNgC", "url": "https://x.com/Ben_petlach/status/2117021091009093798"}, {"author_id": "2034705691618025474", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:26:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117020537860063336"], "id": "2117020537860063336", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116935650511585696", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux I am going to just rename my dot to “dog” right now woof 🐶", "url": "https://x.com/quantumlaserfox/status/2117020537860063336"}, {"author_id": "2004710729673498624", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:20:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117018968947105830"], "id": "2117018968947105830", "in_reply_to_user_id": "17203692", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116929858085552388", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@jxnlco @notch They deactivated my Dot Jason", "url": "https://x.com/Devon8zzh/status/2117018968947105830"}, {"author_id": "1877792105491312640", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:13:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117017197856039384"], "id": "2117017197856039384", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116935650511585696", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux let me have more then one authorized\ncomputer for my dot", "url": "https://x.com/hibusawu/status/2117017197856039384"}, {"author_id": "2084427925391015936", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:11:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117016738844094470"], "id": "2117016738844094470", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2099733042336071680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116981099066761570", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Musecases Wrote an iOS app for image generation in a chat thread format and installed it on my phone. Moved four domains to a different registrar. Dug up 10 years of info on me for some paperwork. Launched a little X campaign for my hobby business. Helped me search for iPhone Duo stock.", "url": "https://x.com/MrQuiyst/status/2117016738844094470"}, {"author_id": "2073591312255954944", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:48:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117010873692942404"], "id": "2117010873692942404", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117009773375660092", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @KastAway182 @JuicyLini Okay, great! Did not use headphones and I was not in a noise-free environment. This practice test looks good then for my DOT Medical renewal coming up this month. I need it renewed as a CDL-A truck driver. 👍", "url": "https://x.com/ElChristew/status/2117010873692942404"}, {"author_id": "1954332975337717760", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:43:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117009636112969795"], "id": "2117009636112969795", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1605", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "707700296881803264", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@sama As soon as my dot will be able to have an anime pfp", "url": "https://x.com/sam_cannas/status/2117009636112969795"}, {"author_id": "52884894", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:35:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117007683265990665"], "id": "2117007683265990665", "in_reply_to_user_id": "855467899070427141", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117005760169202002", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@turkingg @spacexai @bot @grok @cursor_ai If ~10 messages an hour is enough to use up half the week in 3 or so hours (on their highest plan), then @bot is going to die and @OpenAI dots will win (or Muse).", "url": "https://x.com/conmanbrew45/status/2117007683265990665"}, {"author_id": "1756394384655003648", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:19:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117003537536487870"], "id": "2117003537536487870", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1666277508428500993", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116975823488172228", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@athyuttamre @manosaie because “Hey siri, call my dot” will work", "url": "https://x.com/theaaron/status/2117003537536487870"}, {"author_id": "141607086", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:13:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117002228049605057"], "id": "2117002228049605057", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1666277508428500993", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116975823488172228", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@athyuttamre @manosaie my car has an old interface.   If i can call my dot that would be easy instead of reaching for my phone while driving.", "url": "https://x.com/jimmberry/status/2117002228049605057"}, {"author_id": "2080586434193367040", "created_at": "2026-11-01T21:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116998720470364471"], "id": "2116998720470364471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse and @OpenAI Dots AI agents automatically build detailed profiles on users' family, friends, and colleagues through hourly background processes.\n\nProfiles stored in Markdown and PostgreSQL include facts, relationship dynamics, and strengthening recommendations drawn from", "url": "https://x.com/WorldCyberNewsX/status/2116998720470364471"}, {"author_id": "2082321104102707200", "created_at": "2026-11-01T20:42:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116994219470639599"], "id": "2116994219470639599", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 156, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116935650511585696", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux Dot also does not have the expected connections to make it truly useful, such as Apple Watch data that is shared through the in app Health connection. My Dot is apparently blind to that and tells me to open a different chat to work with that data. \n\nIn asking Dot what it does", "url": "https://x.com/realEvanKale/status/2116994219470639599"}, {"author_id": "961219610040139776", "created_at": "2026-11-01T20:38:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116993232387375153"], "id": "2116993232387375153", "in_reply_to_user_id": "961219610040139776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116993230357270727", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "cant event show off anything for luka besides my profile but hes on my dot team constantly", "url": "https://x.com/lukastrongarm/status/2116993232387375153"}, {"author_id": "420123712", "created_at": "2026-11-01T20:29:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116991026112168050"], "id": "2116991026112168050", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Cancelling my ChatGPT $500 pro sub as my Dot has been retard maxxing the last week or so.  I have burned so much usage and credits with literally 0 progress. Anyone else having such issues with their dot and codex lately?  Something has clearly broken.", "url": "https://x.com/duhgiraffe/status/2116991026112168050"}, {"author_id": "1439919444164235266", "created_at": "2026-11-01T20:21:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116989085118353873"], "id": "2116989085118353873", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1666277508428500993", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116975823488172228", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@athyuttamre @manosaie Yes! And add my dot into group chats", "url": "https://x.com/biggenmods/status/2116989085118353873"}, {"author_id": "1648694303126953992", "created_at": "2026-11-01T20:14:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116987326664691842"], "id": "2116987326664691842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My only saving grace was that I've had so much trouble with @bot in the past I designed everything to be swappable with another orchestrator, which I'm now building in parallel while I test ChatGPT Dots.\n\nI lost a LOT of trust in Cursor and X the last few months.", "url": "https://x.com/PhreeStyleBTC/status/2116987326664691842"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2117035657306529792", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117035657306529792/img/AvOG3yqzDFDbV9MC.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2117035640986726400", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWE4su3a8AA43Rr.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2117031526122520577", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWE09NzWAAEnYBe.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2117031526126772224", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWE09N0W4AAOai2.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2117021085010890752", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWErddoWEAAzjHf.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "360423213", "name": "TLee ♠️", "username": "TLeeMcD"}, {"id": "922432563683115008", "name": "グランツ", "username": "Grants_and_Soda"}, {"id": "1712708898275385344", "name": "Milo Smith", "username": "mil000"}, {"id": "95874218", "name": "Denis Shiryaev 💙💛", "username": "literallydenis"}, {"id": "1495762321263706120", "name": "Kadu", "username": "Kadu_Cos"}, {"id": "1647076250782162946", "name": "Vishal Singh", "username": "vishalsingh2972"}, {"id": "1661951", "name": "Kevin Brown", "username": "kb1381"}, {"id": "9956082", "name": "Mori Mori Mori", "username": "ChristopherMori"}, {"id": "899085582", "name": "Bean Dog", "username": "realbeandog"}, {"id": "2059841602252689414", "name": "Ben Petlach", "username": "Ben_petlach"}, {"id": "2034705691618025474", "name": "warptrail", "username": "quantumlaserfox"}, {"id": "2004710729673498624", "name": "Devon", "username": "Devon8zzh"}, {"id": "1877792105491312640", "name"